Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 22:22:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 25/51] Regenerate launcher icons from the cleaned BiPipe
 artwork

The previous icons were generated from the unprocessed source image
which still carried a watermark in its corner. Regenerate all legacy
and adaptive foreground densities from the cleaned artwork instead;
the 66% safe-zone scaling for the adaptive foreground is kept.
---
